---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | HealthFoundry"
  description="HealthFoundry's privacy policy — how we handle data in accordance with HIPAA, DPDP, and applicable data protection regulations."
>
  <section class="privacy-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-meta">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="privacy-body">
        <h2>Our commitment</h2>
        <p>
          HealthFoundry Private Limited ("HealthFoundry", "we", "us") is committed to protecting the
          privacy of individuals whose data we process. This policy describes how we collect, use, and
          protect personal data in connection with our website and services.
        </p>

        <h2>Data we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit an enquiry via our contact form, we collect your name, work email address,
          organisation name, and any information you include in your message. We use this information
          solely to respond to your enquiry and, with your consent, to send relevant communications
          about our services.
        </p>

        <h2>Healthcare data</h2>
        <p>
          HealthFoundry's platform is deployed within customer infrastructure. Patient data processed by
          the Intelligence Fabric remains within the customer's environment and is not transmitted to
          HealthFoundry. We operate in compliance with HIPAA, HITRUST CSF requirements, and India's
          Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act).
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry data is retained for up to 24 months. You may request deletion at any time by
          emailing <a href="mailto:hello@healthfoundry.ai">hello@healthfoundry.ai</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy-related queries, contact us at{' '}
          <a href="mailto:hello@healthfoundry.ai">hello@healthfoundry.ai</a> or write to:<br />
          HealthFoundry Private Limited, Bengaluru, India.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-note">
          This is a summary policy. A full privacy notice will be published prior to commercial launch.
          For any immediate data queries, contact us directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--section-label-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-meta {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .privacy-body {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .privacy-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .privacy-body h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy-body p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .privacy-body a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .privacy-body a:hover {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .privacy-note {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-sm) !important;
    color: var(--text-muted) !important;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
